Anomaly Detection in Financial Fraud | ML , KMeans, DBSCAN, Isolation Forest, PCA	Nov 2024
Developed a fraud detection system using unsupervised learning algorithms (KMeans, DBSCAN, and Isolation Forest) to identify anomalies in financial transactions.
Applied PCA for dimensionality reduction and visualization, enabling clear cluster separation and improved model interpretability.
Used distance thresholding and clustering outputs to isolate high-risk transactions for review.
Evaluated performance using classification metrics and silhouette score, achieving reliable fraud detection on large-scale datasets.
Github Repository Link :	https://github.com/rajnishkumar1906/FinancialFraudDetection
